# Defect 016's bound on an array (panel 230's R2, M-panic-location step 10): an `assert`
# on two arrays of twenty and twenty-one wrote its expression and no side, until the sides were written as
# the specification writes the values, in the lldb formatter's notation and
# within its bounds. The line checked is the one that shows the shape.

function main()
    assert range(from: 0, to: 20) == range(from: 0, to: 21)
